1
00:00:31,449 --> 00:00:32,700
<i>WOMAN: Earth-That-Was</i>

2
00:00:32,784 --> 00:00:35,912
<i>could no longer sustain our
numbers, we were so many.</i>

3
00:00:39,415 --> 00:00:41,626
<i>We found a new solar system,</i>

4
00:00:42,085 --> 00:00:44,879
<i>dozens of planets
and hundreds of moons.</i>

5
00:00:46,589 --> 00:00:49,926
<i>Each one terraformed,
a process taking decades,</i>

6
00:00:50,009 --> 00:00:53,179
<i>to support human life.
To be new Earths.</i>

7
00:00:53,763 --> 00:00:56,140
<i>The central planets
formed the Alliance.</i>

8
00:00:56,391 --> 00:00:58,560
<i>Ruled by an 
interplanetary parliament,</i>

9
00:00:58,643 --> 00:01:01,104
<i>the Alliance was
a beacon of civilization.</i>

10
00:01:02,272 --> 00:01:04,899
<i>The savage outer planets
were not so enlightened,</i>

11
00:01:04,983 --> 00:01:06,985
<i>and refused Alliance control.</i>

12
00:01:07,652 --> 00:01:10,029
<i>The war was devastating.</i>

13
00:01:10,822 --> 00:01:13,032
<i>But the Alliance's victory
over the Independents</i>

14
00:01:13,116 --> 00:01:14,993
<i>ensured a safer universe.</i>

15
00:01:15,159 --> 00:01:17,370
And now, everyone
can enjoy the comfort

16
00:01:17,453 --> 00:01:19,747
and enlightenment
of true civilization.

17
00:01:20,415 --> 00:01:22,834
Why were the Independents
even fighting us?

18
00:01:22,917 --> 00:01:24,877
Why wouldn't they look
to be more civilized?

19
00:01:24,961 --> 00:01:26,421
I hear they're cannibals.

20
00:01:26,504 --> 00:01:27,547
That's only Reavers.

21
00:01:27,630 --> 00:01:28,631
